**Goal Model – Multi‑Robot Food Delivery**

| Goal ID | Goal Title (short) | Text (human readable) | Runtime | Goal Type | Relation |
|--------|---------------------|-----------------------|---------|-----------|----------|
| **G1** | DeliverFoodToRoom | Deliver food from the kitchen to an inpatient’s room. | `;` (sequential sub‑goals) | Perform | AND |
| **G1.1** | AcquireMeal | Acquire meal items from the kitchen. | `#` (parallel tasks) | Perform | AND |
| **G1.1.1** | ReceiveOrder | Receive the order command from the kitchen system. | `-` (leaf) | Perform | AND |
| **G1.1.2** | FetchMealItems | Fetch the meal items from the kitchen shelves. | `-` | Perform | AND |
| **G1.2** | TransportMeal | Transport the meal to the inpatient’s room. | `;` | Perform | AND |
| **G1.2.1** | NavigateToDoor | Navigate to the patient‑room door. | `-` | Perform | AND |
| **G1.2.2** | OpenRoomDoor | Open the room door (robot may ask a human/another robot for help). | `-` | Perform | AND |
| **G1.3** | DeliverMeal | Deliver the meal – either place it on the table or hand it over. | `FALLBACK(G1.3.2, G1.3.1)` | Perform | OR |
| **G1.3.1** | PlaceOnTable | Place the meal on the patient’s table. | `-` | Perform | AND |
| **G1.3.2** | HandOverAndLog | Hand over the meal to the patient/companion/nurse/robot and log the retrieval. | `;` | Perform | AND |
| **G1.3.2.1** | HandOverMeal | Hand over the meal, querying the patient’s ability to fetch from the tray. | `-` | Perform | AND |
| **G1.3.2.2** | LogRetrieval | Log the time and location of the meal retrieval. | `-` | Perform | AND |
| **G1.3.2.3** | AlertWrongMeal | Alert if a wrong meal is retrieved. | `-` | Perform | AND |
| **G1.4** | RetrieveDishes | Retrieve dirty dishes from the patient’s room. | `-` | Perform | AND |

